OL,3,GNEWSABrighton band caught up in riots
OL,4,Aduring Paris gig
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Brighton band have described their
OL,7,Fshock after they had equipment stolen
OL,8,Fin Paris as rioters descended on the
OL,9,Fstreets around the venue where they
OL,10,Fwere playing a gig.
OL,12,FJoe Frampton, the drummer of Dutch
OL,13,FCriminal Record, said the concert had
OL,14,Falready been moved from one venue they
OL,15,Fwere scheduled to play in due to the
OL,16,Frisk of riots in the area.
OL,18,FWhen they arrived at Le Truskel for
OL,19,FSaturday's performance, he said
OL,20,Fdemonstrations were taking place, but
OL,21,Fthe streets were "very peaceful".
OL,22,FHowever, the situation rapidly changed.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
